		{"id":"0db80a2df37e7bd3","type":"file","file":"MOC - 网络入侵检测与机器学习.md","x":-50,"y":-330,"width":400,"height":200},
		{"id":"62cdb510ed9c30f4","type":"file","file":"Outside the Closed World (Sommer & Paxson 2010).md","x":-950,"y":-75,"width":400,"height":350},
		{"id":"2b30ffeb21bc56db","type":"text","text":"# 🔍 核心挑战批判\n为什么异常检测难以落地落地？\n（假阳性极高、语义鸿沟等）","x":-200,"y":50,"width":250,"height":150},
