		{"id":"paper3","type":"file","file":"An End-to-End Framework for ML-Based NIDS (Bertoli et al. 2021).md","x":-50,"y":650,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"text3","type":"text","text":"# ⚙️ 全链路落地工业标准\n不再纸上谈兵，用真实流量加持\n底层架构内核突破，构建闭环！","x":400,"y":650,"width":250,"height":150},
		{"id":"abtrap","type":"file","file":"AB-TRAP 框架.md","x":400,"y":850,"width":250,"height":100},
		{"id":"ebpf","type":"file","file":"eBPF 与模型落地部署.md","x":700,"y":850,"width":250,"height":100},
