		{"id":"paper5","type":"file","file":"Cyber Threat Detection using Event Profiles (Reddy & Bell 2025).md","x":-550,"y":650,"width":400,"height":300},
		{"id":"text5","type":"text","text":"# 💡 破解黑盒与特征提取\n直接回应 2010 年的语义鸿沟批判：\n不用盲目叠深度，只需做准概化特征，\n引入概率图解构黑匣子！","x":-900,"y":550,"width":250,"height":250},
